bind Plan Integration: Integration ID, Integration Status, Integration Type
bind Design System Architecture: Integration ID, Integration Type
bind Develop Integration Components: Integration ID
bind Test Integration: Integration ID, Testing Result, Testing Coverage
bind Deploy Integration: Integration ID, Integration Status, Downtime
bind Monitor System Performance: Integration ID, Number of Errors
bind Resolve Integration Issues: Integration ID, Number of Errors, Downtime
bind Train Users: Integration ID
bind Document Integration Process: Integration ID
bind Review Integration Plan: Integration ID
bind Approve Integration Design: Integration ID
bind Validate Integration Results: Integration ID
bind Update System Documentation: Integration ID
bind Gather User Feedback: Integration ID
Integration ID: integer between 1 and 1000
Integration Status: Planned, In Progress, Completed, Failed
Integration Type: Data, Application, Process
Testing Result: Passed, Failed, Partial
Testing Coverage: float between 0.0 and 100.0
Downtime: float between 0.0 and 24.0
Number of Errors: integer between 0 and 100
Existence[Plan Integration] | |
Responded Existence[Plan Integration, Document Integration Process] | | |
Precedence[Design System Architecture, Develop Integration Components] | | |
Response[Develop Integration Components, Test Integration] | | |
Succession[Test Integration, Deploy Integration] | | |
Chain Response[Deploy Integration, Monitor System Performance] | | |
Alternate Response[Monitor System Performance, Resolve Integration Issues] | | |
Co-Existence[Train Users, Deploy Integration] | | |
Not Chain Succession[Review Integration Plan, Approve Integration Design] | | |
Not Precedence[Approve Integration Design, Validate Integration Results] | | |
Not Response[Update System Documentation, Gather User Feedback] | | |
Choice[Plan Integration, Design System Architecture] | | |
Exclusive Choice[Test Integration, Deploy Integration] | | |
Response[Deploy Integration, Resolve Integration Issues] |A.Integration Status is Failed |A.Downtime >= 0 AND A.Downtime <= 24 |